                    <head>Memorandum Concerning the Citizens of the German Democratic Republic who Remain at the Embassy of the Federal Republic of Germany in Warsaw</head>
                    <msContents>
                        <summary>Information concerning Polish-West German talks about over 50 East German citizens staying at the West German Embassy in Warsaw. How possible solutions could impact Poland’s relations with the <choice>
                                <abbr>GDR</abbr>
                                <expan>German Democratic Republic</expan>
                            </choice> and the <choice>
                                <abbr>FRG</abbr>
                                <expan>Federal Republic of Germany</expan>
                            </choice> are discussed.</summary>
                    </msContents>
                    <history>
                        <origin when="1989-09-14">14.9.1989</origin>
                    </history>
                </msDesc>
            </sourceDesc>
